## if/else
QuantumC uses C-style if/else:
```qc
if (condition) {
    code;
} else {
    code;
}
```

Comparison operators: `==`, `!=`, `>`, `<`, `>=`, `<=`
Logic operators: `&&`, `||`, `!`

---
## Assignment:
TechQ's quantum processor has a stability rating. If `stability` is greater than 75, print `Stable`. Otherwise print `Unstable`.

starterCode:
int main() {
    int stability = 82;
    // Write your if/else here
    return 0;
